": "Screenshot2026-06-18-13-14-09.png", "id": "1411667650758809", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507830479_1411667654092142_8870894027874626134_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=f-cRXxIrEXoQ7kNvwFSe7Qc&_nc_oc=AdpAK1vwn1oabgNES1PEzivXvc2tLymvtmC-p7Bw0XADmxjy4kchWX7bekrWC5RaKRA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9C6XLP6w9XZF0RZvlOnQ9ltxZc4FWF9GuSFJcdhd9SXw&oe=6A3FEBF6"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot2026-06-18-12-57-50.png", "id": "2204903010255527", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823949_2204903016922193_5057111604070029824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RBJ1viVdet8Q7kNvwE0-897&_nc_oc=Adq4bXhY57sww7XDYQGrLOYTsLy_WDTdKQGoy0Z2nKzGAl9CAJDwnFgVwvipK2iu8ZM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8WnHvdpU1eSnj8fq9VCU3z70B_11kb21A6UMu3ZXNFpg&oe=6A3FE655"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot2026-06-18-17-38-49.png", "id": "1186554284540089", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824307_1186554291206755_8640657409862270237_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NMg-vOFoHwUQ7kNvwHjemfc&_nc_oc=AdozucZXXb0pzjr0081NlY5NdN4pWYy49GEWqTo9wUaC-viJ97VsALYJmVmDgpDqhck&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-HH4YsGjkvQrzRnhW8jaXT6qG-jzIpaLP3-mDjaVIUpw&oe=6A3FD8F9"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Fabula", "keywords": ["adventure", "action", "magic", "fairytale", "extraction"], "long_description": "---------------------------------- **LIMITED ACCESS** -----------------------------\n\n**(Opens only on weekends)**\n\nYou're a tiny bear. This is a fairy tale. Nothing is safe or normal.\n\nStep into storybook worlds as a mischievous little beast on a mission: swallow every magical tink you can find, outrun your rivals, and flush yourself to glory. This is Fabula \u2014 free to play on all Meta Quest devices.\n\n\n# \ud83c\udf44 EAT THE LOOT\n\nForget backpacks. You swallow everything. Stuff yourself full, sprint for the toilet, and flush it all into Fame. \n\n\n\n# \ud83d\udebd EXTRACT THROUGH A TOILET\n\nThe only way out is down. Find an extraction toilet, flush yourself through, and everything in your belly converts into Fame. Stay greedy too long and you won't make it.\n\n\n# \u2694\ufe0f YOUR FRIENDS... OR ENEMIES\n\nForm a party, raid together, share the chaos \u2014 or stab each other in the back over a legendary artifact. Up to 10 players, one world, no guarantees. Boss fights, rival parties, and the occasional exploding chicken stand between you and glory.\n\n\n# \u2728 BUILD A LEGEND\n\nRaid storybook worlds, steal from bosses, collect Fame points, betray your friends. The story was never about the heroes anyway.\n\n\n", "short_description": "Be the villain the storybook warned you about. Fabula is a multiplayer VR extraction adventure. Play a mischievous fairy-tale critter and raid iconic storybook worlds. Loot magical artifacts and extract before rival critters snatch them. Team up or backstab in PvPvE chaos, grow your legend, and rewrite the tale. Raid. Loot. Extract."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/widegamestudio.com/fabula-privacy-policy/fabula", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Wide Game Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://widegamestudio.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "su